392 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Of all the many races of Pliara\054 the Humans are the newest known creatures to exist\056 In Pliara\047s original creation\054 Humans did not exist\073 however\054 in the year 3025\054 Humans began to emerge from the magical portal known as Corrow Lake\056 For years\054 the Range Dwarves\054 High Elves\054 and Wyld Elves of Corrow helped the wandering newcomers\054 providing them with food and shelter until they could build a civilization of their own\056 For years\054 the Humans kept coming from the lake\054 filling the ring\055shaped islands of Corrow\056\n\nIn 3031\054 six years after their first arrival\054 the Humans slaughtered the Elves and Dwarves of Corrow\054 planning an invasion of Pliara to conquer the lands in the name of Humans\056 The Druids of Corrow sent a message to Duror\054 whose armies were ready when the Humans\047 ships landed\056 A brutal war ensued\054 resulting in the Humans\047 being defeated and captured\056 Since then\054 the vast majority of Humans have spent their existence as slaves or servants \055 a lesser\054 subservient race to the civilized races of Pliara\056\n\nStanding anywhere between 4\04710\042 and 6\0475\042\054 Human skin tone varies from pale pinks to dark browns with varying degrees of body and facial hair\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 393 0 R
     /Pg 390 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

