396 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Increase any one Ability Score by 2 points and increase any other one Ability Score by 1 point\056\nAge\056 Humans reach adulthood in their late teens and live less than a century\056\nAlignment\056 Humans tend toward no particular alignment\056 The best and the worst are found among them\056\nSize\056 Humans vary widely in height and build\054 from barely 5 feet to well over 6 feet tall\056 Regardless of your position in that range\054 your size is Medium\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 30 feet\056\nDarkvision\056 You have spent most\054 if not all\054 of your life in dark\054 dim dungeons\056 Even those Humans lucky enough to escape servitude would find themselves hiding\054 forced to dark caverns and other hiding places\056 As a result\054 you have developed superior vision in dark and dim conditions\056 You can see in dim light within 30 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You can\031t discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read\054 and write Common and one extra language of your choice\056 Humans typically learn the languages of other peoples they deal with\054 including obscure dialects\056 They are fond of sprinkling their speech with words borrowed from other tongues\072 Orc curses\054 Elvish musical expressions\054 Dwarvish military phrases\054 and so on\056\nMulti\055Faceted\056 You gain one feat of your choice\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 397 0 R
     /Pg 390 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

